{"src":"en","tgt":"fr","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"fr","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5823.348163,"text":"Lions are the most social cats living in large groups called prides."},{"kind":"text","t":6136.677151,"text":"Les lions sont les félins les plus sociaux, vivant en grands groupes appelés troupes."},{"kind":"audio","t":6202.30445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6207.7506029999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6212.721302999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":6213.5321619999995,"samples":11496,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":11427.535304,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":11753.755381,"text":"Dans le climat chaud du Moyen-Orient, la maison n'était pas si importante."},{"kind":"audio","t":11808.974216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11814.090184,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11819.37036,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":11820.113139000001,"samples":11496,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":17735.746205,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":18213.449645,"text":"Ce sont presque toutes des plages de sable avec une baignade sécurisée et la plupart disposent d'un ombrage assuré par"},{"kind":"audio","t":18265.07142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":18270.150389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18275.492813999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18280.871248,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18286.251722999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18289.645125,"samples":18560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":20584.909055,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":20706.023213999997,"text":"des arbres pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":20752.702578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20752.930935,"samples":11032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":26127.409152,"text":"Brides are made up of 1 to 3 related adult males along with us"},{"kind":"text","t":26470.065679,"text":"Les groupes sont composés de 1 à 3 mâles adultes apparentés ainsi que de nous."},{"kind":"audio","t":26526.145801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26531.444937,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":26536.860971,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26539.960257,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":32623.400776999995,"text":"Feral children may have experienced severe child abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"text","t":33139.208581,"text":"Les enfants sauvages peuvent avoir subi des maltraitances graves ou des traumatismes avant d'être abandonnés ou de s'enfuir."},{"kind":"audio","t":33197.230426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33198.459959,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33200.212633999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33201.739132999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33203.738895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33204.270307,"samples":17960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":38536.821954,"text":"Scottport Bus 403 travels regularly to Centra stopping at Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":38977.161709,"text":"Le bus 403 de Scottport se rend régulièrement à Centra en s'arrêtant à Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":39022.099288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39023.706605,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39025.730917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39027.665159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39028.523277,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":45862.368267,"text":"To get the best views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head for the Kowloon waterfront opposite."},{"kind":"text","t":46409.648599,"text":"Pour profiter des meilleures vues de Hong Kong, quittez l'île et dirigez-vous vers le front de mer de Kowloon, juste en face."},{"kind":"audio","t":46459.304582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46464.639657,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":46470.031000999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46475.385886,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46480.735220999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46481.049996,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":51216.868655,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":51624.698405999996,"text":"Les points de vue d'Aristote étaient acceptés sur toutes les questions scientifiques, y compris la physiologie."},{"kind":"audio","t":51682.583303,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51687.888389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51693.322351999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51698.670987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51701.593896,"samples":23128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":61155.969396,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's competitor"},{"kind":"text","t":61578.181865,"text":"L'Australien Mitchell Gowrie a terminé 11e du Super G debout masculin, le concurrent de Chet."},{"kind":"audio","t":61635.141725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61640.433301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61645.799425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61651.210268999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61652.057677,"samples":12328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":67033.350829,"text":"Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":67328.797599,"text":"Ulrich Joklin a terminé 16e du Super G assis masculin."},{"kind":"audio","t":67382.14456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67387.351567,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67392.632843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":67392.89403899999,"samples":6096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":73776.367674,"text":"The city is in stark contrast to the rest of the country's cities because it is more of an Arabic flair than of an Arabic flair."},{"kind":"text","t":74181.386435,"text":"La ville contraste fortement avec les autres villes du pays car elle a davantage un style arabe qu'un style arabe."},{"kind":"audio","t":74241.011827,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74246.278343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74251.628828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74257.043192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74262.358667,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":74262.625693,"samples":4160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":84762.071413,"text":"Also, after revolution, occupants were open to all male applicants, allowing the most ambitious and successful to succeed."},{"kind":"text","t":85312.61346,"text":"De plus, après la révolution, les postes étaient ouverts à tous les candidats masculins, permettant aux plus ambitieux et aux plus performants de réussir."},{"kind":"audio","t":85375.074493,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85380.043423,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85385.389018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85390.544046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85396.151307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":85401.494422,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85403.467084,"samples":18192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":91857.537257,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":92328.341354,"text":"La bombe à fission repose sur le principe qu'il faut de l'énergie pour assembler un noyau comprenant de nombreux protons et neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":92388.524259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92393.503629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92398.707316,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92404.05145099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92409.347846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92412.350804,"samples":25160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":97447.564337,"text":"He did not set a figure for the cuts, saying they will be made based on China's economic output."},{"kind":"text","t":97951.640397,"text":"Il n'a pas fixé de montant pour les coupes, déclarant qu'elles seront effectuées en fonction de la production économique de la Chine."},{"kind":"audio","t":98011.875361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98016.825381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":98022.215375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98027.55137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98032.866846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98034.950516,"samples":19760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":105767.320404,"text":"There is no universal definition for which manufactured items are antiques. Some tax agencies define goods older than 100 years."},{"kind":"text","t":106132.791861,"text":"Il n'existe pas de définition universelle pour déterminer quels articles manufacturés sont des antiquités. Certaines administrations fiscales définissent les biens de plus de 100 ans."},{"kind":"audio","t":106181.97316,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106187.190766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106192.59666,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":106197.778468,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106203.023944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":106203.270521,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":106254.065517,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106259.56178999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106264.969814,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106266.381154,"samples":15696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":113930.649598,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":114306.741586,"text":"Dans l'archipel et les lacs, vous n'avez pas nécessairement besoin d'un yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":114370.99428299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114376.291009,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114381.542965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":114382.065258,"samples":10896,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":123575.277745,"text":"The aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest whole number ratio, is therefore said to be 3 to 2."},{"kind":"text","t":124236.523237,"text":"Le rapport d'aspect de ce format, en divisant par 12 pour obtenir le rapport d'entiers le plus simple, est donc dit être de 3 pour 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":124305.774085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":124311.237978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124316.909228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":124322.046046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124327.351501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124332.683336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":124332.940793,"samples":3192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":131843.64602400002,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":132453.26117100002,"text":"Il est réputé pour être un épicentre du luxe qui a débuté vers 400 apr. J.-C. et a duré jusqu'à"},{"kind":"audio","t":132510.379969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132515.532926,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132520.74333300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132523.84386000002,"samples":24696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"audio","t":132572.2648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132574.642926,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":136087.606211,"text":"until about 1100 AD."},{"kind":"text","t":136321.50711600002,"text":"environ 1100 apr. J.-C."},{"kind":"audio","t":136376.547293,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136377.10612500002,"samples":14632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"audio","t":136427.26836000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":136427.65444500002,"samples":832,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":145376.82416100003,"text":"Cancellation policies vary but as of late March most coronavirus based cancellation policies don't extend to July 2020 when the Olympics"},{"kind":"text","t":146095.75489200003,"text":"Les politiques d'annulation varient, mais fin mars, la plupart des politiques d'annulation liées au coronavirus ne s'étendent pas jusqu'en juillet 2020, date à laquelle les Jeux olympiques"},{"kind":"audio","t":146179.44420700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146184.595884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146189.88052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146195.196945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146200.52105100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146205.889335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146211.10972200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146214.22001800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":146214.485634,"samples":656,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":154643.39781800003,"text":"Swirl the two dry powers together and then with clean wet hands squeeze them into a ball"},{"kind":"text","t":155163.050029,"text":"Mélangez les deux poudres sèches, puis, avec des mains propres et humides, pressez-les pour former une boule."},{"kind":"audio","t":155220.248125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155223.29173300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155226.584116,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":155229.96566900003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155230.556841,"samples":15328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":162237.95261100002,"text":"St. Petersburg cruises include time in town. Cruise passengers are exempted from visa requirements."},{"kind":"text","t":162568.14656300002,"text":"Les croisières à Saint-Pétersbourg incluent du temps en ville. Les passagers de croisière sont exemptés des exigences de visa."},{"kind":"audio","t":162621.40496500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162626.699851,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162629.368843,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"audio","t":162663.28665700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162668.879228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162674.248533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":162674.565529,"samples":9096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":173405.200201,"code":1005}]}